{"steamAppId":4813190,"description":"Join the Bark Scouts on their annual trip to Camp Whittlewood, a former logging camp nestled deep within a protected forest. But before the outdoor fun can begin, you're teased by an old story about a woodcarver who stalks the camp. Shunned by your peers, scour the campground to uproot its gnarled history before it buries you.\nFEATURES\nA short horror adventure with old-school RPG interaction mechanics\n\nKey items to find to progress through the story\n\nMultiple unique endings to discover\n\nA strange crew of fellow campers with distinct personalities\n\nCozy pixel art with chilling cutscenes\n\nAn original hair-raising soundtrack","short_description":"Camp Whittlewood is an old-school horror RPG. You've been dropped off for a weekend of outdoor fun, but soon find bullies are the least of your problems when a twisted campfire story begins to come true.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813190/6eaeb83e707c36e2f3c8c90e5b6c04cd00100221/header.jpg?t=1789312448","developer":"NickSchemes","publisher":"NickSchemes","genre":"Приключенческие игры, Инди, Ролевые игры","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":null,"releaseLabel":"28 сен. 2026 г.","comingSoon":true,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":null,"steamReviewCount":null,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813190/c8c9dcd8f003bb859c06e6aafb328292f0651ca8/ss_c8c9dcd8f003bb859c06e6aafb328292f0651ca8.600x338.jpg?t=1789312448","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813190/c8c9dcd8f003bb859c06e6aafb328292f0651ca8/ss_c8c9dcd8f003bb859c06e6aafb328292f0651ca8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789312448"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813190/327c0a6c244c467395ffb7ec71e559238734016a/ss_327c0a6c244c467395ffb7ec71e559238734016a.600x338.jpg?t=1789312448","full":"https://shared.aka